input type=\"number\" id=\"upSpeed\" name=\"upSpeed\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"downSpeed\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Down Speed</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"downSpeed\" name=\"downSpeed\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"motorHP\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Motor HP</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"motorHP\" name=\"motorHP\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n        </div>\n        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-medium mb-4\">Landings / Openings</h4>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"landings\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Landings</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"landings\" name=\"landings\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"fopenings\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Front Openings</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"fopenings\" name=\"fopenings\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"ropenings\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Rear Openings</label>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"ropenings\" name=\"ropenings\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n        </div>\n        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-medium mb-4\">Jack - Plunger Diameter</h4>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"plungerDiameter\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Plunger Diameter</label>\n            <select id=\"plungerDiameter\" name=\"plungerDiameter\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" required>\n                <option value=\"\"></option>\n                <option value=\"2-s\">2-S</option>\n                <option value=\"3-s\">3-S</option>\n                <option value=\"4-s\">4-S</option>\n                <option value=\"5-s\">5-S</option>\n                <option value=\"6-s\">6-S</option>\n            </select>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <label for=\"notes\" class=\"block text-gray-700 font-medium mb-2\">Notes</label>\n            <textarea id=\"notes\" name=\"notes\"\n                class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 w-full rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-400\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"bg-blue-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-600\">Submit</button>\n        </div>\n\n    </form>\n</div>"
